WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:06.390
Introducing DOG, the number one memecoin
on the largest blockchain.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.190
DOG is a fascinating project that's set
to revolutionize the Bitcoin ecosystem.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:20.790
Since its launch, DOG has taken the crypto world by storm.
The cute puppy in the orange hoodie has brought new excitement.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:29.750
Let's take a brief look at why DOG has become so popular
and learn what's in store for its future.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:36.790
Meet Casey Rodarmor, the mastermind behind the Runes protocol.
His vision was to create a seamless way to mint and manage tokens.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:43.869
Fungible tokens on Bitcoin could bring people to the chain
and ultimately draw them to Bitcoin, the asset.

00:00:43.879 --> 00:00:50.310
Enter DOG. Launched in April 2024,
DOG is a memecoin built on Bitcoin.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:55.670
It was the brainchild of Ordinals developer
and Runestone founder Leonidas.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.069
One hundred billion DOG tokens were airdropped
to holders of the Runestone Ordinal project.

00:01:00.079 --> 00:01:05.710
Runestones were Bitcoin Ordinal NFTs
given free to early Ordinals adopters.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:11.270
DOG's goal is similar to Casey's vision for Runes:
bring more people into Bitcoin.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:18.230
Its mission is to build a strong community around
fungible memecoin tokens on Bitcoin.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:26.149
And onboard millions of people to the Bitcoin ecosystem.
But there is one important difference from other memecoins.

00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:33.990
As Leonidas puts it, DOG's real story is that it was
airdropped free to the original Ordinals community.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.789
It was a 100% volunteer initiative,
with no presale and no team allocation.

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:47.109
No paid marketing, no centralized-exchange listing fees,
no favoritism toward whales, and no gifts to influencers.

00:01:47.119 --> 00:01:55.429
It's time to opt out of the rigged memecoin casino
and opt into the free and fair movement.

00:01:55.439 --> 00:02:03.149
That free and fair movement immediately resonated.
DOG reached a half-billion-dollar market cap in just four days.

00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:10.389
The introduction of Runes like DOG is having
a positive impact on the Bitcoin ecosystem.

00:02:10.399 --> 00:02:17.990
More transactions from Rune-based tokens can mean higher miner fees,
offering miners additional revenue streams.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:25.670
Community-based memecoins like DOG also attract new users
to the Bitcoin network.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:32.710
They expand its user base and drive innovation.
DOG is more than just a token.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:38.070
It's a movement within the Bitcoin ecosystem,
full of growth, excitement, and endless possibilities.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:43.160
Join the DOG community today
and become part of Bitcoin's future.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:50.640
[Music]

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.000
[Applause]
